                        "description":  {
                                            "en":  "Capri in the corner of the DSH window. She reacts to the agent\u0027s tools, answers in her own words, shows a panel with her face, plays quiet synthesized cues, and comes to you with the alarm when the agent needs a permission. Settings cover size (50-400 %), side, language, sound and approval alerts.",
